#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:5
#: 145997d18919419b93baa7df4139436d
msgid "TeraRanger Tower/ Tower EVO (360 Lidar)"
msgstr "TeraRanger Tower / Tower EVO（360度激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:7
#: 2f0baeabc4ee455c826d0967c1764a03
msgid ""
"The Tower is no longer available and has been replaced by the Tower EVO."
msgstr "Tower 已停产并被 Tower EVO 替代。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:9
#: 820d18d9b7814f92ac12a0ad0b46cb29
msgid ""
"The `TeraRanger Tower <https://www.terabee.com/portfolio-item/teraranger-"
"tower-scanner-for-slam-and-collision-avoidance/>`__ can be used for Object "
"Avoidance in Loiter and AltHold modes.  The sensor has a maximum usable "
"range of about 4.5 meters."
msgstr ""
"`TeraRanger Tower <https://www.terabee.com/portfolio-item/teraranger-tower-"
"scanner-for-slam-and-collision-avoidance/>`__ 可用于 Loiter 和 AltHold "
"模式下的避障。该传感器的最大可用测距约为 4.5 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:11
#: 70e90880a67d41cf89445568d8a78a7d
msgid ""
"The `TeraRanger Tower EVO <https://www.terabee.com/shop/lidar-tof-multi-"
"directional-arrays/teraranger-tower-evo/>`__ can be used for Object "
"Avoidance in Loiter and AltHold modes.  The sensor has a maximum usable "
"range of about 60 meters."
msgstr ""
"`TeraRanger Tower EVO <https://www.terabee.com/shop/lidar-tof-multi-"
"directional-arrays/teraranger-tower-evo/>`__ 可用于 Loiter 和 AltHold "
"模式下的避障。该传感器的最大可用测距约为 60 米。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:14
#: 6834ef4d128f4f8bacfc1237f2147623
msgid "Mounting the Sensor and Connecting"
msgstr "安装传感器并连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:19
#: d5e45fd89a174d78989da0ef470d34df
msgid ""
"The TeraRanger Tower should be mounted on the top of the vehicle so that "
"sensors scans horizontally and its view is not obstructed by any portion of "
"the vehicle including GPS mast, vehicle legs etc."
msgstr "TeraRanger Tower 应安装在飞行器顶部，使传感器水平扫描且视野不被飞行器任何部分（包括 GPS 支架、起落架等）遮挡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:22
#: b49eac7a953047f2a0acc9238bbeb7f4
msgid "Configuration through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站进行配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:23
#: 1805d18c37614163b40ac308821b77cd
msgid "Example setup below shown for first proximity sensor:"
msgstr "以下示例适用于第一个近距离传感器的设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:25
#: 8d6322e6c558497b8af106d65d56c7d4
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = \"11\" (\"Lidar360\") if using "
"Serial4."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 「11」（「Lidar360」），使用 Serial4 "
"时设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:26
#: e5d80c7d93544cb39e6c505147591041
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` =  \"921\" if using Serial4."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 「921」，使用 Serial4 时设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:27
#: 29457d1825b3426691bd3f0ebaa08529
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = \"3\" to enable the TeraRanger Tower, = \"6\""
" for Tower EVO (or 0 to disable)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 「3」以启用 TeraRanger Tower，= 「6」表示 Tower EVO（或 0"
" 禁用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:28
#: 9fbeabbec32346fc85304eba66753e33
msgid ":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = \"0\" Default."
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = 「0」默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-teraranger-tower-objectavoidance.rst:30
#: 4b7c8cca5e624c9ebbdda21d59e364de
msgid ""
"More details on using sensors for object avoidance on Copter can be found "
":ref:`here <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"关于在 Copter 上使用传感器进行避障的更多详情，请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`。"
